  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to PFM reforms in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To contribute to the PFM reform process entailed by the Government of Egypt and the Ministry of Finance, including the post-COVID fiscal context.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Component 1:&lt;/u&gt; To support the Government of Egypt, and specifically the Ministry of Finance and its affiliated entities, in the path towards further reforming the PFM system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Component 2:&lt;/u&gt; To support the EU Delegation on (i) assessing the PFM reform in Egypt; (ii) updating the PFM Annual Monitoring Reports; (iii) drafting the Terms of Reference (ToRs) of an upcoming EU action supporting PFM.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
